                        "name": "Souvik Roy",
                        "email": "souvikroyofficial10@gmail.com",
                        "username": "souvik1914581"
                    },
                    "message": "Why not use `std::get_if<>` instead of using a combination of `std::holds_alternative<>` and `std::get<>`?\n\n`std::get_if<>` is `noexcept` as well, which is better use for this API as there is no local `catch()` block here."
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/include/utility/vpd_specific_utility.hpp",
                    "line": 1599,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Anupama B R",
                        "email": "anupama.b.r1@ibm.com",
                        "username": "branupama"
                    },
                    "message": "for IPZ type VPD extraction is different from other VPD types.\n So once that's confirmed, am extracting IPZVpdMap using std::get diretly.\nthis way helping avoiding of creating of types::IPZVpdMap type variable outside the if condition at line 1591."
                },
